<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 16.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 16.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 16     July 15   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  281.500     281.020     247.020   13.96 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.920     309.550     306.830    1.01 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.990     156.700     158.970   -1.25 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.474	46.396	47.182   -1.50 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  472.460     474.040     419.180   12.71 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.435     139.175     141.685   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.135	16.129	16.185   -0.31 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  243.090     245.950     212.430   14.43 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.863	 1.860	 1.888   -1.32 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.555	 1.553	 1.581   -1.64 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.545     190.975     183.135    4.05 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
